+
+No quiz, scores, points, achievements, high scores, speed bonus, assessment result, mastery claim or emoji anywhere in the source. Draw real SVG illustrations/icons. Preserve all four native parent-validated ActionEngine commands, shared real transitions, 48-pixel responsive controls and separate assistance from learner action.
+
+Use an actual supplied video URL with native controls when the frozen plan requires observation; do not replace it with a poster or play icon. Real 3D, if included, uses manipulable geometry and reachable alternative controls. Return only one complete HTML document, without echoing authoring instructions or engineering notes.
